1. e4 { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] e4 is the most common of moves in the chess universe. } 1... e5 { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] Play Nf3 } 2. Nf3 Nc6 { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] Now play Bc4 } 3. Bc4! { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] This is the Italian opening } *


