{ [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] This is the French Defence, also a good choice for you to improve. This opening is, in my opinion, very underrated. }
1. e4 { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] e4 is the most common move in the world in chess. Now most people would be like, "PLAY E5 QUICKLY, WHAT ARE YOU DOING??". No need to worry about e5 here. just play e6 } { [%csl Ge6][%cal Ge7e6] } 1... e6!! { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] Now begins the French Defence. White will 89% of the time play d4. } 2. d4 { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] White plays d4 to get a good center. No worries. Just play d5 and contest the center! } { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gd7d5] } 2... d5! { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] There are multiple variations of the French. I am going to tell you the two most common ones. } *


