{ Here comes my favorite opening as Black. The Sicillian Defense is the most common reply after 1.e4. It is played at the Grandmaster level and in my opinion, the most aggressive option for black to play. white first plays e4 to start the game. }
1. e4 { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] Now play c5 } 1... c5!! { [%anno "ArjunShukla23", arjunshukla23] c5 is a good option because it prevents d4 and it takes the center with the flank pawn. Like all the other openings like Caro-Kann, Sicillian also has a lot of variations. Lets check out the most common one in the next chapter. } *


