PLAY NF6!! } 2... Nf6!! { Counterattack with the Petrov! } { [%csl Ye5,Be4][%cal Yf3e5,Bf6e4] } 3. Nxe5 { [%csl Ge7][%cal Gd8e7] } 3... Qe7 4. d4 { [%csl Gd6][%cal Gd7d6] } 4... d6 5. Nf3 { [%csl Ge4][%cal Ge7e4] } 5... Qxe4+ 6. Be2 { [%csl Gf5][%cal Gc8f5] } 6... Bf5 7. Na3 { [%csl Ge7][%cal Ge4e7] } 7... Qe7 8. O-O { [%csl Gd7][%cal Ge7d7] } 8... Qd7 9. c4 { [%csl Gc6][%cal Gc7c6] } 9... c6 10. Nc2 { [%csl Ge7][%cal Gf8e7] } 10... Be7 11. Ne3 { [%csl Gg6][%cal Gf5g6] } 11... Bg6 12. b3 { [%csl Gg8][%cal Ge8g8] } 12... O-O 13. Bb2 { [%csl Ga5][%cal Ga7a5] } 13... a5 $14 { [%csl Ba4,Bb5,Bc5][%cal Ba5a4,Bb7b5,Bc6c5] } *


