{ Now let's learn the Scandinavian defense. }
1. e4 { Let's play D5! } 1... d5! 2. exd5 { Follow my arrows to learn the Scandi ! } { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gd8d5] } 2... Qxd5 3. Nc3 { [%csl Ga5][%cal Gd5a5] } 3... Qa5 4. Nf3 { [%csl Gc6][%cal Gb8c6] } 4... Nc6 5. d4 { [%csl Ge6][%cal Ge7e6] } 5... e6 6. Bf4 { [%csl Gb4][%cal Gf8b4] } 6... Bb4 7. Qd2 { [%csl Gf6][%cal Gg8f6] } 7... Nf6 { [%csl Re4][%cal Rf6e4,Re4c3,Re4d2] } 8. Bd3 { [%csl Gg8][%cal Ge8g8] } 8... O-O 9. O-O { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gf6d5] } 9... Nd5 $15 { Now you have a great position! } *


