{ Now we will learn the Slav! }
1. d4 { To play the Slav, play d5. } 1... d5 2. c4 { Now, play c6. } 2... c6! { Reinforces the center. } 3. Nc3 { Follow my Arrows to learn the Slav! } { [%csl Gc4][%cal Gd5c4] } 3... dxc4 4. e3 { [%csl Gb5][%cal Gb7b5] } 4... b5 5. a4 { [%csl Gb4][%cal Gb5b4] } 5... b4 6. Ne4 { [%csl Gd5][%cal Gd8d5] } 6... Qd5 7. Nd2 { [%csl Gc3][%cal Gc4c3] } 7... c3 8. bxc3 { [%csl Gc3][%cal Gb4c3] } 8... bxc3 9. Nb1 { [%csl Ga5][%cal Gd5a5] } 9... Qa5 10. Qc2 { [%csl Gf6][%cal Gg8f6] } 10... Nf6 11. Qxc3 { [%csl Gc3][%cal Ga5c3] } 11... Qxc3+ 12. Nxc3 { [%csl Ga5][%cal Ga7a5] } 12... a5 13. Ba3 { [%csl Ge6][%cal Ge7e6] } 13... e6 14. Bxf8 { [%csl Gf8][%cal Gh8f8] } 14... Rxf8 15. Be2 { [%csl Ge7][%cal Ge8e7] } 15... Ke7 16. Nf3 { [%csl Ga6][%cal Gc8a6] } 16... Ba6 17. Bxa6 { [%csl Ga6][%cal Gb8a6] } 17... Nxa6 18. Ke2 { [%csl Gc5][%cal Gc6c5] } 18... c5 $10 { Now yo know how to play the Slav! } *


