{ A lot of people mess this up. Designing good studies.

Now I will teach you some rules to make your studies good.

1. The chapters should be in order.
I see many people not arrange their studies properly and these studies look absurd.

2.Don't make a Study on something already discussed. make something new!
If you make studies on the same topic, then people will not look at your study. So, make something new.

3. Try for an Interactive Lesson
People generally like Interactive Lessons over Normal Analysis. So, if you want your study to attract likes, going for an interactive Lesson is your best bet🙂

Bonus Tip: Always put an introduction and conclusion chapter!

So, that is some rules I suggest you to follow to make good studies🙂
- rooks-pawn }
